# Maven 3.10+ scopes server credentials to the origins declared for a server id,
# defaulting to https://repo.maven.apache.org. Our <server id="central"> credentials
# (injected by actions/setup-java, which cannot emit <repositoryOrigins>) therefore
# stop applying to https://central.sonatype.com, and deploys fail with HTTP 401.
# Restore id-only credential matching until the settings can declare origins directly.
-Dmaven.repository.credentialScope=id
